# Production security headers for Quiz on Demand.
#
# Parsed by Cloudflare Workers Static Assets (and by `wrangler dev` locally). Vite copies
# this file from public/ into dist/, the [assets] directory in wrangler.toml. It is not
# itself served as an asset. There is no Worker script in this project, so every response
# is a static asset and every response gets these headers.
#
# A single catch-all rule on purpose: when several rules match a path Cloudflare merges
# them and comma-joins repeated headers, which would split the CSP into two policies.
#
# CSP, directive by directive (the app is one same-origin JS bundle + one stylesheet):
#   default-src 'none'        deny everything not explicitly allowed below
#   script-src 'self'         /assets/index-*.js only; no inline script, no eval
#   style-src 'self'          /assets/index-*.css only. React style props are applied
#                             through the CSSOM, which CSP does not govern, so no
#                             'unsafe-inline' is needed
#   img-src 'self'            /favicon.svg
#   connect-src 'self'        fetch('/sample-quiz.json') and Vite's modulepreload polyfill
#   base-uri 'none'           no <base> tag exists; forbid injecting one
#   form-action 'none'        the app submits no forms; does not fall back to default-src
#   frame-ancestors 'none'    the app may not be framed (clickjacking)
# Uploaded quiz files are read with File.text(), which CSP does not restrict. The download
# links are plain same-origin navigations, which CSP does not restrict either.
#
# Deliberately omitted (see README "Security headers"): Strict-Transport-Security,
# Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy, X-XSS-Protection, require-trusted-types-for,
# report-uri / report-to.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), browsing-topics=(), camera=(), clipboard-read=(), display-capture=(), encrypted-media=(), fullscreen=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), picture-in-picture=(), publickey-credentials-get=(), screen-wake-lock=(), serial=(), usb=(), xr-spatial-tracking=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
